{title: Nalam Vazha}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Ilaiyaraaja}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
Nalam [Bm] vaazha ennaalum en,        [G] vaazhth [Bm] thukkal
[Bm] Thamizh koorum pallaandu,        [G] en vaarth [Bm] thaigal
[Bm] Ilavaenil un vaasal,        van [Dm] dhaadum
Ilan [Bm] thenral un [Bb] meedhu,        pan paa [Bm] dum
[Bm] Manidhargal silanaeram,        [Bm] thadam maaralaam
[Bm] Manangalum avar gunangalum,        [Bm] niram maaralaam
[Bm] Ilakkanam sila naeram,        [Bm] thavaraagalaam
[Bm] Ezhudhiya anbu ilakkiyam,        [Bm] pizhaiyaagalaam
[GM] Viralgalaith thaandi,        [F#] valarndhadhaik kandu
[F] Nagangalai naamum,        [F#] narukkuvadhundu
[A] Idhil enna [Dm] paa [A] vam,        [F#] edharkindha [Bm] soa [F#] gam
[G] Kili [C#] yae... [Bb] aeae [Bm] ae
